interfaces, output formats, and all related materials provided with it.

"You" means any individual or legal entity exercising permissions under this License.

"Evaluation Purpose" means private, internal, non-commercial review, inspection,
academic reading, security review, compatibility assessment, or offline testing
solely for understanding or evaluating the Software, and not for operational,
production, commercial, customer-facing, or service-delivery purposes.

"Radio Output" means any generation, modulation, replay, transmission, streaming,
playback, or output of RF, IF, baseband, or digitally synthesized signals to any
SDR, USRP, DAC, RF front-end, test instrument, antenna path, or transmission-capable
hardware.

"Automated Extraction" means any scraping, crawling, indexing, mining, embedding,
vectorization, dataset creation, model training, model fine-tuning, retrieval
augmentation, or other automated collection or processing of the Software or its
contents by software, scripts, bots, agents, pipelines, or machine learning systems
for the purpose of training, improving, or augmenting machine learning or AI models.

Notwithstanding the foregoing, standard developer tools (IDEs, text editors,
linters, compilers, debuggers, local search and indexing tools, build systems,
and version control tools) that do not feed into ML/AI model training or dataset
construction are not considered Automated Extraction.

"Derivative Works" means any work that is based on the Software and for which the
editorial revisions, annotations, elaborations, or other modifications represent
an original work of authorship, including but not limited to modifications,
adaptations, translations, ports, or any altered version of the Software.

